  ⚠ angular-template(no-negated-async): Async pipe results should not be negated.
   ╭─[no_negated_async.html:1:4]
 1 │ {{ !(foo | async) }}
   ·    ──────────────
   ╰────
  help: Use `(observable | async) === false`, `(observable | async) === null`, or `(observable | async) === undefined` to check its value instead

